{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Elixr 是一款結合吸收科學的營養補充品追蹤工具，適合正在服用多種補充品、想整理服用時段與提醒的人使用。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-162.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>補充品相互作用提示</h2>\n<p>Elixr 會標示可能互相抵觸的補充品組合，並附上 15 組 PubMed 研究連結。每種補充品可設定與食物、空腹或遠離咖啡茶等條件，再按時段檢查配合與否。提醒可依每日、指定星期或每隔數天安排，通知會列出到期項目；主畫面小工具亦可查看未完成事項並直接勾選。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-431-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-432-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-433-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-434-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-435-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-436-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Elixr – Supplement Tracker</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/elixr-supplement-tracker/id6762560637?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.903748+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T10:12:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:31.501102+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:31.501102+00:00","content_hash":"7294ec7861c69a9e5f2879b99b24b958b3d65c5f47e67cc41e4fed1e80a0532e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}